{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1539768-need-stats-for-a-mummy-bbeg","id":1539768,"title":"Need stats for a Mummy BBEG","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-03T16:13:34-07:00","id":1539768,"title":"Need stats for a Mummy BBEG","content":"TLDR: Can someone point me to a stat block / write up for a super powerful (and preferably evil) Mummy? I would prefer something official, but third party will work as well.<br /> <br /> I am not super familiar with Mummy the Resurrection; however I am going to have a mummy as one of the big villains for my next game. Rather than starting from scratch though, I would like to work backwards from a stat block. <br /> <br /> This is going to be a very high-power games, so I am looking for something on the upper end of the power curve, the mummy equivalent of a Methuselah or Archmage, preferably something that can go toe to toe with a pack of rank 4-5 garou.<br /> <br /> The exact details of the character don't really matter, as I am going to reskin it to match the needs of my game, I just need a mechanical framework to hang the skin off of.<br /> <br /> Thank!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26576-talakeal","name":"Talakeal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-03T17:09:09-07:00","id":1539769,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Bane_Mummies\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Bane_Mummies</a><br /> <br /> The individual entries have the stat blocks for all seven of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T05:34:36-07:00","id":1539786,"title":"","content":"Thank you!<br /> <br /> On closer examination, this is less useful than it looks, as it isn't actually a separate stat block for each of them, but rather one unique ability and then the same attribute ranges reprinted seven times. Still, its a nice starting point, and I appreciate it.<br /> <br /> Maybe I could use Horus or one of the other heroic mummies instead, although that might be a bit much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26576-talakeal","name":"Talakeal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T06:02:44-07:00","id":1539790,"title":"","content":"I recommend taking a look <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1504244-the-followers-of-set-as-an-enemy-faction-in-werewolf\">here </a>how to make Bane Mummies more distinct as antagonists. Not much stat-wise but a lot of useful info on mood and adjacent cults.<br /> <br /> The thing with the similar stats is that at the general power level of Bane Mummies their Hekau are more than enough to pump them up if they need it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}